{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Part of this video was sponsored by LastPass. Stick around to the end for a word from our sponsor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5760,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In a recent study participants were placed in a room for between 6 and 15 minutes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10900,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were given nothing except a button that they knew would shock them if they pressed it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16240,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were asked to entertain themselves with their thoughts,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19180,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they could self administer the shock if they so chose."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23820,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what happened?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25080,
    "dDurationMs": 7240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, 25% of women and 67% of men shocked themselves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32320,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is despite the fact that they had previously told the experimenters"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36280,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that they would pay money to avoid the shock."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38940,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Apparently they'd rather experience physical pain than just be bored;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43580,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to have nothing to keep them occupied but their thoughts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47020,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But they are not alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49320,
    "dDurationMs": 6700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Around 95% of American adults report participating in some leisure activities over the past 24 hours."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56020,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But only 17% say they spent any time at all just relaxing and thinking,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62500,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because that apparently is boring, and being bored is unpleasant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67720,
    "dDurationMs": 7120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what is boredom? Well contrary to popular belief, it's not when you have absolutely nothing to do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74840,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's just when none of the options you have available to you appeal to you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79120,
    "dDurationMs": 6700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Boredom is characterized by a lack of concentration, restlessness, but also feeling lethargic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85820,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's really a state of being underwhelmed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88860,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there are now more ways than ever to avoid boredom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93060,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With Facebook, Twitter, Instagram, Snapchat, YouTube,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96700,
    "dDurationMs": 5260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not to mention my chronic news I have waiting in line, sitting in a coffee shop, stopped at a traffic light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101960,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Many people reach for their phones to stave off boredom, and nowhere is sacred."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107600,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you ever just let yourself be bored?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110460,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, no, I generally don't."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112500,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But are we losing anything by avoiding boredom?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115700,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, scientific research says yes, and what we're losing is important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123440,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you're bored your mind wanders."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127500,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's only natural."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130420,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The state of boredom is one where your attention is not focused on anything in particular."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136860,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Researchers have shown this mind wandering is useful for creativity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142180,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They gave study participants a random boring task. The most boring one: reading the phone book."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149220,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then, they asked participants to be creative;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151700,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "generate as many ideas as they could for what you could do with a plastic cup."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156180,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those in the most boring read the phone book condition"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159360,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "generated the most creative solutions compared to less bored controls."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165810,
    "dDurationMs": 4070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A major reason many researchers suspect that we experience boredom"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169880,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is because it gives you an indicator of your current state."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172940,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, if you find yourself feeling bored, you know something about that situation isn't working for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178100,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me ask you this. When you're in class and you're a bit bored"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180760,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "do you ever just pull out your phone and have a look at stuff?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182880,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. All the time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185600,
    "dDurationMs": 6700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the paradox of boredom is that it makes you feel tired, sluggish and just disinterested."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192300,
    "dDurationMs": 6460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it may actually spur you to action. It may get you to make changes that would be positive for your life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199520,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And changes like getting this guy's legs out of my face. That would be perfect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205800,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the absence of boredom, one would remain trapped in unfulfilling situations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210900,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and miss out on many emotionally, cognitively and socially rewarding experiences."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216140,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Boredom is both a warning that we're not doing what we want to be doing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219980,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a push that motivates us to switch goals and projects."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223920,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Studies have also shown that boredom may make you more altruistic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228240,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Perhaps the acute sense of aimlessness you experience when you're bored gets out of control,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233060,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and makes you question what you're doing with your life as a whole."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236240,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the silver lining is that it may trigger you to think about others and what you can do to help them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241400,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that provides an immediate and concrete purpose to a life that might momentarily feel like it's lacking one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247560,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, studies designed to induce boredom have shown"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250520,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that more bored participants are more likely to donate to charity, or to give blood."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255220,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can I ask what led you to donate blood today?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259860,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had free time in my hands. You know, just, waiting for 2 hours, an hour and a half or so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263980,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So apparently the opportunity to do meaningful,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267260,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even if unpleasant activities have more value if you're bored than if you're not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273440,
    "dDurationMs": 5980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Similarly, this aimless state seems to cultivate thoughts about what you want to do with your life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279420,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To think of your life as a story and consider where you want it to go in the future."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283920,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is called autobiographical planning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286780,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When given tasks that only use a fraction of mental capacity,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290140,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "study participants frequently thought of the future and their plans for it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294340,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this way being bored is essential for goal-setting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297820,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If your brain is always consumed with other stimuli,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301600,
    "dDurationMs": 6300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you'll rarely ponder the bigger picture and set long-term goals for yourself and consider how to achieve them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307900,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Does a phone get rid of your boredom?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311120,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, actually, thinking about it, it does."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314640,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So every time you're waiting for something,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316960,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have a decision to make which seems like a tiny one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320560,
    "dDurationMs": 6700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pull out your phone for a few seconds or minutes, or just be bored; experience only your thoughts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327260,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like an insignificant decision."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329860,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you don't give it much thought the obvious action is to see what's new on your app of choice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334940,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in making that decision you are alleviating a moment of boredom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339200,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you are also likely making yourself less creative, less altruistic,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344040,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "less likely to assess your current state and less likely to set goals for your future."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349000,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In short, you are the real world example of someone shocking themselves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353460,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to avoid the unpleasantness of boredom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356460,
    "dDurationMs": 7200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Except in your case, the pain goes much deeper to the very nature of who you are, and who you will become."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363660,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So think carefully before pressing that button."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371980,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, being bored is apparently something our brains need to do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376380,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Something our brains don't need to do, is remember lots of random passwords."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380820,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which is why the sponsor of this video is LastPass."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384280,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "LastPass is a password manager"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386480,
    "dDurationMs": 7520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that offers unlimited password storage plus free sync across all your devices, and password breach alerts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394000,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That way you never have to remember another password or write it down,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398100,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "look for one, forget your passwords, reset them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400700,
    "dDurationMs": 6360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All of that hassle is just pushed aside and you can put your passwords on autopilot with LastPass."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407060,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that way you can free up your valuable brain space for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410540,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just being bored and thinking about your life rather than remembering your passwords."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415340,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, LastPass has multi-factor authentication which is super important because it keeps your accounts secure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420580,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It also interfaces with Microsoft and Yubikey's multi-factor authentication."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425140,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And one feature I love about LastPass is it allows you to share,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428740,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "safely and securely, your passwords with other people who may need them for certain accounts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434240,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a very handy feature."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436200,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you want to check out LastPass, click on the link in the description."
    } ]
  } ]
}
